    "view": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong></p><ol><li><p>Generate public key using</p></li></ol><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7fd69df0-437a-4256-b42e-55cad1ec0c3e\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">ssh-keygen -t rsa </pre>\n</div></div><ol><li><p>For latest DBeaver, ​Run this on your key to convert it to RSA private key.</p></li></ol><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d3ca53ab-e161-4233-9084-d394bf0b7407\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">ssh-keygen -p -m PEM -f ~/.ssh/id_rsa </pre>\n</div></div><p><strong>MYSQL:</strong></p><p><strong>Tools:</strong></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c6a83a3b-bbd6-45a4-a80e-56fc5bd4fc82\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">1.MySQLWorkbench\n2.DBeaver </pre>\n</div></div><p><strong>Connecting using MySQLWorkbench:</strong></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3f4617f5-35fc-45a9-973d-7cea562dae2d\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">Change the connection method to Standard TCP/IP over SSH, by default, connection method will be set to Standard (TCP/IP) \nHostname: “&lt;DomainName&gt;” \nUsername: “centos”\nSSH key file path: “provide the path to id_rsa file” \nMySQL Hostname: “localhost” \nMySQL Server Port: “3306” \nUsername: “root”</pre>\n</div></div><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2318893350/11_1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1618383729393&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2318893350/11_1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1618383729393&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"638\" data-width=\"832\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2361524258\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"11_1.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"2318893350\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"3\" data-media-id=\"fc136671-e149-4e49-b668-a30fb0ef7f01\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span><p>Once all the details are added, Test Connection and ideally you see the “Connection Successful” popup.</p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"680\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/2318893350/Picture%202.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611552243&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=680&amp;height=384\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2318893350/Picture%202.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611552243&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"211\" data-width=\"373\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2306736405\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Picture 2.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"2318893350\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"3\" data-media-id=\"7fe6065c-3a11-4f31-8533-3729f46c2d07\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/2318893350/Picture%202.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611552243&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=746&amp;height=422 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/2318893350/Picture%202.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611552243&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=680&amp;height=384 1x\"></span><p /><p><strong>POSTGRESS:</strong></p><p><strong>Tools:</strong></p><h2 id=\"Bahmni-MartSetupwithMySQLWorkbench&amp;DBeaver-DBeaver\"><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://dbeaver.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\">DBeaver</a></h2><h3 id=\"Bahmni-MartSetupwithMySQLWorkbench&amp;DBeaver-ConnectingtoPOSTGRESSusingDBeaver:\"><strong>Connecting to POSTGRESS using DBeaver:</strong></h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"89275be8-1d94-44ea-bacf-567a2d93da6c\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">Select postgress DB while creating a new connection \nSelect SSH tab and check “Use SSH Tunnel” option \nHost/IP: “&lt;DomainName&gt;” \nPort: 22 \nUser Name: “centos” \nAuthentication Method: “Public Key” \nPrivate Key: “provide the path to id_rsa file” </pre>\n</div></div><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"680\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/2318893350/Picture%203.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611612105&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=680&amp;height=584\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2318893350/Picture%203.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611612105&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"402\" data-width=\"468\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2306736411\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Picture 3.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"2318893350\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"3\" data-media-id=\"eb743840-8113-4b87-9908-bc8fb8891264\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/2318893350/Picture%203.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611612105&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=936&amp;height=804 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/2318893350/Picture%203.png?version=3&amp;modificationDate=1617611612105&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=680&amp;height=584 1x\"></span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2318893350/12_1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1618383806314&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2318893350/12_1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1618383806314&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"1040\" data-width=\"936\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2361524265\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"12_1.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"2318893350\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"3\" data-media-id=\"ba0dfb87-b444-493e-92fd-7aa89fdffd56\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span><p /><p>Once all the details are added, Test Connection and ideally you see the “Connection Successful” popup. </p><p />",
